# INGF-01, mirroring the CRPS-01/CRPS-03 precedent. Keep LF in the working tree (git
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite these on a Windows checkout, and envelope rendering is
# compared byte-for-byte). The repository-root .gitattributes is unallocated by breakdown plan §4
# and is not touched.
* text eol=lf
